      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 37 McKee Avenue, a superb four bedroom extended mid-terrace bungalow ideally positioned within this highly sought-after residential location in Finglas East.\n\nSituated on McKee Avenue, this spacious family home comes to the market in great condition throughout and boasts a large rear extension, converted attic, gas-fired central heating and rear vehicular access. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to downsize alike.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a double bedroom, bright and spacious living room, single bedroom with built-in wardrobes, further single bedroom, double bedroom and main family bathroom. The hallway continues through to a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area, with the kitchen providing access to a separate utility room. The kitchen further opens into a large rear extension currently used as a sunroom, creating an excellent additional living space and providing direct access to the fully paved rear garden.\n\nThe property further benefits from a converted attic, offering excellent additional space and versatility, while externally there is a front garden and a fully paved rear garden with rear access suitable for vehicle access. No. 37 also benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and c. 117 sq.m of accommodation.\n\nMcKee Avenue enjoys an excellent and highly convenient location close to Finglas Village and a host of local amenities. Residents are within easy reach of numerous shops, cafés, restaurants, public houses, supermarkets, schools, sports clubs and recreational facilities. The area also benefits from excellent transport links, with numerous Dublin Bus right outside the property providing regular services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The M50 and M2 motorways are also within easy reach, providing ease of access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and all major national routes.\n\nThis property offers a fantastic combination of generous living accommodation, excellent extension space and a highly convenient location. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the size and potential of this superb home.\n\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861985247 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing or register your interest.\n\nAdditional Features\n• C. 117 sqm\n• BER D2\n• Built 1950\n• Spacious four bedroom extended bungalow\n• Large rear extension\n• Converted attic\n• Bright and spacious living room\n• Open-plan kitchen/dining area\n• Large rear sunroom\n• Utility room\n• Two double bedrooms\n• Two single bedrooms, one with built-in wardrobes\n• Family bathroom\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Double-glazed windows\n• Front garden\n• Fully paved rear garden\n• Rear access suitable for vehicle access\n• Excellent potential for growing families\n• Mature and highly sought-after residential location\n• Walking distance of Finglas Village\n• Excellent selection of schools and amenities nearby\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Easy access to Dublin City Centre\n• Minutes from the M50 and M2 Motorways\n• Early viewing highly advised"
      },
